  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;２　保証債務&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;下記関係会社の取引債務の保証を行っております。&lt;/p&gt;
